<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Standard Products upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Standard Products upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Barrington Research analyst Alexander Paris said he raised his rating on Standard Products Co to 2-Buy from 3-Hold.</p>
<p>--Shares in the manufacturer of auto components and other products closed Thursday at 24-1/4.</p>
<p>--&quot;The long-awaited recovery is under way,&quot; Paris said.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
